VERSION 1.31.3
------------------------
o Tidy dependencies: MSnbase is now only listed in Depends, and the unused
  Suggests statmod, testthat and vdiffr have been removed
o Declare the column names used in dplyr, tidyr and ggplot2 code as global
  variables, so R CMD check no longer reports them as undefined

VERSION 1.31.2
------------------------
o Fix computeDiffStats contrasts: group names containing "_vs_" are no longer
  rewritten, and contrasts such as "(A - B) - (C - D)" now work
o computeDiffStats: numeric batchEffect columns are now treated as factors
o Fix coefVar cumulative fraction plot to show the proportion of features
  with a CV less than or equal to x
o Replace deprecated tidyverse and ggplot2 code; now requires R >= 4.1.0,
  ggplot2 >= 3.5.0 and purrr >= 1.0.0
o Use the native R pipe (|>) instead of the magrittr pipe (%>%); magrittr is
  no longer imported
o Correct and extend the vignette and help pages

VERSION 1.31.1
------------------------
o Fix computeDiffStats: pass the TechRep block to lmFit so the duplicateCorrelation
  consensus correlation is used (previously it was silently ignored)
o Document TechRep usage in computeDiffStats and convertToMSnset

